{
  "id": "5ffdaf7d9d061900416b3d2d",
  "title": "アイコン後付け記法",
  "created": 1610461054,
  "updated": 1789880760,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "5ffdaf7d9d061900416b3d2d",
      "text": "アイコン後付け記法",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461054,
      "updated": 1610461054
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdaf801280f000008a805a",
      "text": "[アイコン記法]を文末につけるやりかた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461056,
      "updated": 1610461071
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdaf7e1280f000008a8058",
      "text": "　い｛アイコンA} {アイコンB}",
      "userId": "661b6e882a96e9002371b3c2",
      "created": 1610461054,
      "updated": 1715764674
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdaf7f1280f000008a8059",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461055,
      "updated": 1610461055
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdb0131280f000008a8067",
      "text": "利点",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461203,
      "updated": 1610461205
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdb0191280f000008a806a",
      "text": "　同じ意見に対して[同意]するのがかんたん",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461209,
      "updated": 1610521913
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdb0251280f000008a806b",
      "text": "　 `わかる[a.icon*2][b.icon][c.icon*5]`と書けばいい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461221,
      "updated": 1610461247
    },
    {
      "id": "60b7b7091280f00000eba366",
      "text": "　 [アイコン前付け記法]だと、簡単に同意を表せない",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1622652681,
      "updated": 1622761900
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdb0151280f000008a8069",
      "text": "欠点",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461205,
      "updated": 1610521858
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffe9d03e5172d000043da2f",
      "text": "\tアイコンの数が増える",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1610521858,
      "updated": 1610521907
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffe9d12e5172d000043da30",
      "text": "\t\t新しい意見を書くたびにアイコンをつけることになる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1610521874,
      "updated": 1610521896
    },
    {
      "id": "606145ce1280f00000b18cb0",
      "text": "\t\tこれって欠点なのかな？[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1616987599,
      "updated": 1616987608
    },
    {
      "id": "6061e79ae5172d00006cbeff",
      "text": "\t\t　別に困った記憶はないな…[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1617029018,
      "updated": 1617029029
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffdb0151280f000008a8068",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1610461205,
      "updated": 1610461205
    },
    {
      "id": "614c609b1280f00000d5007d",
      "text": "from [アイコン記法を付ける位置]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1632395420,
      "updated": 1632395420
    },
    {
      "id": "614c609b1280f00000d5007f",
      "text": " [複数人Project]の場合はこっちが推奨されると思う",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1632395420,
      "updated": 1632395428
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf627000000000007fcf8a",
      "text": " 　特にそうは思わない。使い分ければよい[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789878897,
      "updated": 1789879273
    },
    {
      "id": "614c609b1280f00000d50080",
      "text": " 同じ意見だということを表しやすい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1632395420,
      "updated": 1632395428
    },
    {
      "id": "614c609b1280f00000d50081",
      "text": "  e.g. [/forum-jp]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1632395420,
      "updated": 1632395428
    },
    {
      "id": "614c609b1280f00000d50082",
      "text": "  たしかに[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1632395420,
      "updated": 1632395428
    },
    {
      "id": "63e0785879e11300005c8612",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d89b1f60230ae001779e113",
      "created": 1675655256,
      "updated": 1675655259
    },
    {
      "id": "63e0785879e11300005c8613",
      "text": "　[Create my page]で作られるページでは、アイコン後付け記法が使われている",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1675655256,
      "updated": 1675655280
    },
    {
      "id": "63e0786179e11300005c8614",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d89b1f60230ae001779e113",
      "created": 1675655265,
      "updated": 1675655265
    },
    {
      "id": "6a2f84a70000000000034d91",
      "text": "誰が言ったかよりも発言内容が先に来る印象を受け、気に入っている[kana.icon]",
      "userId": "5e9487d750011b001eb536eb",
      "created": 1781499048,
      "updated": 1781499075
    },
    {
      "id": "6a2f84ae0000000000034d92",
      "text": " +1[yosider.icon][uminosachinomisokatsu.icon]",
      "userId": "69e3880c2d8712a4688ed0cf",
      "created": 1781499055,
      "updated": 1782646757
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf628e00000000007fcf8b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789878927,
      "updated": 1789878979
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf62c300000000007fcf8d",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]箇条書きの発言主体の判別しづらさの原因の一つがこれ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789878980,
      "updated": 1789879429
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf647600000000007fcf90",
      "text": "　前付けにするだけで自動的にアイコン幅分の字下げが行われる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789879415,
      "updated": 1789880308
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf67f100000000007fcf92",
      "text": "　　このアイコンの幅または左右の `margin:` を箇条書きのインデントの幅と揃えれば行頭が揃い、複数行を瞬時に読み取りやすくなる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789880306,
      "updated": 1789880443
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf67ee00000000007fcf91",
      "text": "　　視覚的にも瞬時に別人の発言と判別できる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789880303,
      "updated": 1789880304
    },
    {
      "id": "6a40f3d6000000000089e03e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1782641621,
      "updated": 1782641621
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf696c00000000007fcf93",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789880685,
      "updated": 1789880760
    }
  ]
}